  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a decreasing&nbsp;function</p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>So, range:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p>"
